This product includes software, robot descriptions and 3D models from the following projects, each licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- XLeRobot (https://github.com/Vector-Wangel/XLeRobot)
  Robot description (simulation/xlerobot/xlerobot.urdf) and meshes, vendored unmodified in hardware/upstream/xlerobot/
  (see SOURCE.md there for the exact commit); body, tower and neck-housing geometry derived from its CAD.

- SO-ARM100 / SO-ARM101 by TheRobotStudio (https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100)
  Arm geometry and meshes, distributed as part of the XLeRobot files above.

- LeRobot by Hugging Face (https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot)
  The robot plugin in plugins/ is written against the LeRobot robot API.

The browser simulator uses MuJoCo (Apache-2.0, Google DeepMind) and three.js (MIT), installed from npm.
